      "content": "Localized issues like this can sometimes point toward problems with the transfer paper itself or the sublimation ink formulation. Check if the transfer paper has any subtle micro-wrinkles or residue spots, as these imperfections can interrupt the dye transfer process. Additionally, ensure your ink batch is fresh and chemically compatible with the polyester blend you are using.",
